Day 15 — Data Scaling & Early Stopping 🧠

Continuing my #100DaysOfDeepLearning journey with Day 15.

Today I learned two important concepts for improving neural network training:

🔹 Early Stopping — stopping training when the model stops improving, helping prevent overfitting.
🔹 Data Scaling & Normalization — bringing features to a similar scale so the model can train faster and more effectively.

I also understood why unscaled data can make the loss surface uneven, while normalized data makes optimization more balanced.

Another day of focusing on understanding the concepts before implementing them. 🚀

